<title>CHINA: Peregrine sets warrants on HK Telecom.</title>
<headline>Peregrine sets warrants on HK Telecom.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Friday it issued 250 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.  STRIKE PRICE	HK$21.76     PREMIUM	 23.6 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.3152    GEARING	 6.4x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  17.JUN.98    LISTING DATE  07.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    PAYDATE	 04.AUG.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$20.15     MIN EXER LOT  4,000</p>
<p> NOTE		  PHYSICAL DELIVERY OR CASH AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>			 DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
